{
  "name": "Day 45 Solution: AI Agent Learning",
  "description": "Learning agent system that runs reinforcement, supervised, and unsupervised learning passes in parallel, analyzes the results, and generates adaptive behavior updates via an LLM.",
  "tags": [
    "week-07",
    "ai-agents",
    "day-45",
    "learning",
    "solution"
  ],
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 45 Solution: AI Agent Learning\n\nSimulates a learning agent that runs reinforcement, supervised, and unsupervised learning passes in parallel over training data, analyzes the combined results, then asks an LLM to propose adaptive behavior updates.\n\n**Credentials needed:** OpenAI API key for the Adaptive Behavior Update node to run for real. The httpRequest learning/results/log nodes call fake placeholder domains and need no real credential.\n\nSee DAILY_TASKS/DAY_45_AI_Agent_Learning.md for the full lesson this solves.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "learning-agent-system",
      "name": "Learning Agent System",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "learning-agent",
        "httpMethod": "POST"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "initialize-learning-system",
      "name": "Initialize Learning System",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "learning_session_id",
              "value": "={{ $now.format('YYYYMMDDHHmmss') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "learning_type",
              "value": "adaptive"
            },
            {
              "name": "start_time",
              "value": "={{ $now }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "learning_algorithms",
              "value": "={{ ['reinforcement', 'supervised', 'unsupervised'] }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "process-learning-data",
      "name": "Process Learning Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        720,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "training_data",
              "value": "={{ $json.training_data || 'Sample training data for learning' }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "performance_metrics",
              "value": "={{ $json.metrics || { 'accuracy': 75, 'efficiency': 80, 'satisfaction': 4.0 } }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "learning_objectives",
              "value": "={{ $json.objectives || ['improve_accuracy', 'increase_efficiency', 'enhance_satisfaction'] }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "reinforcement-learning",
      "name": "Reinforcement Learning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.learning-service.com/reinforcement-learning",
        "bodyContentType": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"learning_session_id\": $json.learning_session_id, \"training_data\": $json.training_data, \"performance_metrics\": $json.performance_metrics, \"learning_type\": \"reinforcement\", \"timestamp\": $now } }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "supervised-learning",
      "name": "Supervised Learning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.learning-service.com/supervised-learning",
        "bodyContentType": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"learning_session_id\": $json.learning_session_id, \"training_data\": $json.training_data, \"performance_metrics\": $json.performance_metrics, \"learning_type\": \"supervised\", \"timestamp\": $now } }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "unsupervised-learning",
      "name": "Unsupervised Learning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.learning-service.com/unsupervised-learning",
        "bodyContentType": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"learning_session_id\": $json.learning_session_id, \"training_data\": $json.training_data, \"performance_metrics\": $json.performance_metrics, \"learning_type\": \"unsupervised\", \"timestamp\": $now } }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-learning-services",
      "name": "Learning Services Placeholder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        960,
        720
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚠️ Placeholder endpoint\n\nThis node calls a fake domain that does not exist. Replace the URL with a real service endpoint (or mock server) before running this for real — this is a stand-in for teaching purposes.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 460
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "analyze-learning-results",
      "name": "Analyze Learning Results",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1200,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "reinforcement_results",
              "value": "={{ $('Reinforcement Learning').item.json.results }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "supervised_results",
              "value": "={{ $('Supervised Learning').item.json.results }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "unsupervised_results",
              "value": "={{ $('Unsupervised Learning').item.json.results }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "learning_improvement",
              "value": "={{ Math.floor(Math.random() * 20) + 10 }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "adaptive-behavior-update",
      "name": "Adaptive Behavior Update",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1440,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "gpt-4",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are an AI learning system that analyzes learning results and generates adaptive behavior updates."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ 'Learning Results:\\nReinforcement: ' + $json.reinforcement_results + '\\nSupervised: ' + $json.supervised_results + '\\nUnsupervised: ' + $json.unsupervised_results + '\\n\\nGenerate adaptive behavior updates and optimization recommendations.' }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3,
          "maxTokens": 500
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "generate-learning-report",
      "name": "Generate Learning Report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1680,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "learning_report",
              "value": "={{ { \"learning_session_id\": $json.learning_session_id, \"learning_type\": $json.learning_type, \"start_time\": $json.start_time, \"training_data\": $json.training_data, \"performance_metrics\": $json.performance_metrics, \"learning_objectives\": $json.learning_objectives, \"reinforcement_results\": $json.reinforcement_results, \"supervised_results\": $json.supervised_results, \"unsupervised_results\": $json.unsupervised_results, \"learning_improvement\": $json.learning_improvement, \"adaptive_updates\": $json.choices[0].message.content, \"processing_time\": $now.diff($json.start_time, 'milliseconds'), \"completed_at\": $now } }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "success_message",
              "value": "✅ AI agent learning processing completed successfully"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "send-learning-results",
      "name": "Send Learning Results",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1920,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.learning-service.com/results",
        "bodyContentType": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"results\": $json.learning_report, \"timestamp\": $now } }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "log-learning-activity",
      "name": "Log Learning Activity",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        2160,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.learning-log.com/log",
        "bodyContentType": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"type\": \"agent_learning\", \"data\": $json.learning_report, \"timestamp\": $now } }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-send-log",
      "name": "Send/Log Placeholder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1920,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚠️ Placeholder endpoint\n\nThis node calls a fake domain that does not exist. Replace the URL with a real service endpoint (or mock server) before running this for real — this is a stand-in for teaching purposes.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 460
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "handle-learning-error",
      "name": "Handle Learning Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        480,
        600
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "learning_error",
              "value": "={{ { \"error_type\": \"learning_failed\", \"learning_session_id\": $json.learning_session_id, \"message\": \"AI agent learning failed\", \"timestamp\": $now } }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "error_response",
              "value": "={{ { \"status\": \"error\", \"learning_session_id\": $json.learning_session_id, \"message\": \"AI agent learning workflow error\" } }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Learning Agent System": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Initialize Learning System",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Initialize Learning System": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Process Learning Data",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Handle Learning Error",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Process Learning Data": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Reinforcement Learning",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Supervised Learning",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Unsupervised Learning",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Reinforcement Learning": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Analyze Learning Results",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Supervised Learning": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Analyze Learning Results",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Unsupervised Learning": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Analyze Learning Results",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Analyze Learning Results": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Adaptive Behavior Update",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Adaptive Behavior Update": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Generate Learning Report",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Generate Learning Report": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Learning Results",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Send Learning Results": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Log Learning Activity",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {},
